The pisu'o default on loi is unfortunate, then, not just because
piQ looks to be generally mabla but because we have the strange
situation whereby:
{loi} means "a fraction of loi"
{piroloi} means "loi"
So all {piro} does is cancel the implicit {pisu'o}.

